  .pagetab{display:inline-block;background:#343a42;border:1px solid #6b7684;color:#eef3f8;text-decoration:none;font-size:17.5px;font-weight:800;padding:14px 24px;border-radius:14px}
  .pagetab:hover{background:#3f4650;border-color:#8b97a6}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
  <div style="margin:0 0 20px"><a class="pagetab" href="file:///Users/nakfaai/output/projects/status.html">Projects · hintza · salsa · books &#8594;</a> <a class="pagetab" href="file:///Users/nakfaai/output/apps/evidence.html">Owner evidence · what each Bot proved &#8594;</a></div>
  <h1>What is missing, app by app</h1>
  <p class="stamp">Checked ${esc(checked)} America/Chicago · Apple API, Google Play API, Xcode Cloud API, folders on the Mac</p>
